2026-07-27T10:11:00.1981623Z i /tmp/RtmpLskUwa/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1981927Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1982272Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1982579Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1983052Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1983983Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:11:00.1984789Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
